# Keep build context small and never leak local state/secrets into images.
# Applies to both images (both build from the repo root).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
.git
.github
docs
*.md
# Local secrets & env — images get config from compose, never from a baked .env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Local attachment object store (ADR-0007) — never copy uploaded files into an image.
var/
backend/var/
# Editor / OS / spec
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.docx
*.log
